>## Encode a Hydra term to a YAML node via JSON encoding.
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term toYaml = λtypes,tname,typ,`term`.eithers.map (λv.jsonToYaml v) (toJson types false tname typ `term`)
#^^^^ source.hydra keyword.other.definition.hydra
#    ^ source.hydra
#     ^^^^^^ source.hydra entity.name.function.hydra
#           ^ source.hydra
#            ^ source.hydra keyword.operator.equals.hydra
